Package: sentia-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends:
 sentia-desktop-settings,
 chromium,
 dbus-x11,
 lightdm,
 lightdm-gtk-greeter,
 network-manager,
 network-manager-gnome,
 pavucontrol,
 policykit-1-gnome,
 pulseaudio | pipewire-audio,
 thunar,
 xdg-user-dirs,
 xdg-utils,
 xfce4-notifyd,
 xfce4-panel,
 xfce4-pulseaudio-plugin,
 xfce4-session,
 xfce4-settings,
 xfce4-terminal,
 xfdesktop4,
 xfwm4,
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Sentia minimal Xfce desktop metapackage
 Minimal Debian 13 desktop baseline for Sentia images.
 This package intentionally pulls only essential Xfce, LightDM,
 networking, audio controls, Chromium, and file manager components.
 It avoids broad task bundles and does not depend on Sentia AI packages.

Package: sentia-desktop-settings
Architecture: all
Depends:
 xdg-utils,
 xfce4-taskmanager | gnome-system-monitor,
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Sentia desktop launchers, wallpaper, and defaults
 Ships Sentia-owned desktop launchers, wallpaper, and Xfce defaults.
 Includes compatibility wrappers so menu entries remain usable before
 the native Sentia terminal and system monitor binaries are available.
